The Requirement Analysis phase defines the functional and non-functional requirements of the project “ToyCraft Tales: Tableau's Vision into Toy Manufacturer Data.”

In this phase, we identify the required dataset, database setup, SQL operations, and Tableau dashboard features.

It ensures the system can perform data cleaning, analysis, and generate interactive visualizations such as sales trends, profit analysis, and category-wise performance.

This phase guarantees that all business and technical requirements are clearly understood before development begins.
